### Result
- [Screenshot of full page](artifacts/review1/card-1440-light.png)
### Ran Playwright code
```js
// Screenshot full page and save it as artifacts/review1/card-1440-light.png
await page.screenshot({
  fullPage: true,
  path: 'artifacts/review1/card-1440-light.png',
  scale: 'css',
  type: 'png'
});
```

### Result
{
  "width": 1440,
  "notes": 2,
  "meters": 2
}
### Ran Playwright code
```js
await page.evaluate('()=>{if(document.documentElement.scrollWidth>innerWidth)throw Error(\'Overflow\');if(!document.querySelector(\'.reviewer-flag\'))throw Error(\'Missing advisory flag\');if(document.querySelector(\'button:not(:disabled)\'))throw Error(\'Recording has live decision\');return {width:innerWidth,notes:document.querySelectorAll(\'.reviewer-notes li\').length,meters:document.querySelectorAll(\'meter\').length};}');
```

